        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 3.6,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 7.47,
          "en": "we registered our controls and we made our form submittable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.47,
          "end": 8.94,
          "en": "So that is what we did.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.94,
          "end": 11.19,
          "en": "Then we can still use that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.19,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "Now I want to add validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "For example, the name should be required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 21.62,
          "en": "This must not be empty, and the same for our number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.75,
          "end": 23.07,
          "en": "Now, it should be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 26.28,
          "en": "And due to the fact that this input is of type number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 30.42,
          "en": "it should already be hard to enter anything else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.42,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "So with this, we now added some validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 37.02,
          "en": "Now to take advantage of this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.02,
          "end": 41.37,
          "en": "I want to disable the Add button if the form is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.37,
          "end": 44.1,
          "en": "So we'll bind to disabled here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 48.69,
          "en": "and we'll disable it if form is not valid, if this is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 50.1,
          "en": "So if this check here is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.1,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "and this will be true if the form is not valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.52,
          "end": 55.05,
          "en": "So let's save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.05,
          "end": 55.883,
          "en": "And this looks good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.883,
          "end": 57.87,
          "en": "I can't click the Add button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.87,
          "end": 58.799,
          "en": "Now let's try again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.799,
          "end": 61.17,
          "en": "Let's insert something into amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.17,
          "end": 62.13,
          "en": "This works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "Of course, a negative amount works too though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "So an easy way of making sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "that we may only enter numbers greater than zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 75.36,
          "en": "is to use another built-in validator, the pattern validator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.36,
          "end": 79.53,
          "en": "This will check the user input against a regular expression.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 82.71000000000001,
          "en": "Now the regular expression achieving what we're looking for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.71000000000001,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "would be the following one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 87.33,
          "en": "which needs to be pasted between single quotation marks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.33,
          "end": 89.01,
          "en": "so as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.01,
          "end": 90.57,
          "en": "It's this one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.57,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "Since it's a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "we can also omit these single quotation marks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 96,
          "en": "and omit the square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96,
          "end": 98.78999999999999,
          "en": "to use the shortcut of using property binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.78999999999999,
          "end": 100.14,
          "en": "when binding to a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.14,
          "end": 102.81,
          "en": "where we don't have to use the square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 102.81,
          "end": 104.19,
          "en": "So what this will basically do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 105.75,
          "en": "this regular expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 105.75,
          "end": 108.99000000000001,
          "en": "it will allow any number greater than zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 108.99000000000001,
          "end": 110.16,
          "en": "So we can see this in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 110.16,
          "end": 113.72999999999999,
          "en": "If we now save this and go back to the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 113.72999999999999,
          "end": 117.69800000000001,
          "en": "If I add Bread and 1, this is valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 117.69800000000001,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "-: 1 doesn't work, -10 doesn't work, -01 doesn't work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 126.3,
          "en": "plus 01 does work, 10 does work, and 0 does also not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.3,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "So it does exactly what I want it to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 132.63,
          "en": "So now we added validation to this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.63,
          "end": 133.74,
          "en": "Now let's make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 133.74,
          "end": 136.53,
          "en": "that once we click one of the existing items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 136.53,
